# Lock line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# The upstream repository has no .gitattributes while this machine has
# core.autocrlf=true, so a checkout produced CRLF working files against LF
# blobs. That combination makes every cross-machine sync report whole-file
# rewrites, and `md5sum` disagree on files whose blobs are identical.
# `eol=lf` also forces the working tree to LF, so a writer that ignores
# gitattributes still commits LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be text-converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
